Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:10.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（白俄罗斯 明斯克）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:01.85,Title,0,0,0,0,,《碟中谍5：神秘国度》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:04.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国 伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:54.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华盛顿特区）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:48.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六个月后）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:51.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（古巴 哈瓦那）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:20:59.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中央情报局 弗吉尼亚州 兰利）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:12.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（班吉·邓恩 亲启）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.10,0:25:36.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（奥地利 维也纳）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.90,0:52:04.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（摩洛哥 卡萨布兰卡）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.34,0:01:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没空跟你聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh. I can't talk right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.49,0:01:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西已经上飞机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The package is on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在制定第二方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're currently formulating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然严格上来说 这已经是第三方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}a plan B although technically, it's a plan C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情进展的不太顺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't going very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道 勃兰特 你这么说也无济于事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am aware of that, Brandt. You're not helping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森究竟在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我们已经关闭了无线电联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We're on radio silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.78,0:01:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西在飞机上 不能让它就这么起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That plane cannot takeoff, with the package on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白吗 - 我们正想办法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand? - We're working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟 你跑那去干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther? What the hell are you doing there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该在马来西亚执行任务才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are supposed to be on an assignment in Malaysia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在马来西亚 已经来了两天了 班吉需要我的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in Malaysia, I've been here 2 days. Benji needed my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要帮助 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't need help. I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要协助 完全两回事好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed assistance, it's a different thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西还在飞机上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The package is still on that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道东西还在飞机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand the package is on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在尝试通过远程控制破坏他们的系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to cripple it remotely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以做到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要飞行员还开着卫星上行链接就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can if the pilot left the satellite uplink switch on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.93,0:02:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而他确实没关闭 - 你是怎么接入卫星上行链接的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which he has. - And how do you access the uplink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就需要黑进一颗俄罗斯卫星了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It involves hacking a Russian satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可不会批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't authorise that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.85,0:02:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我也没征求同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I didn't ask permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正因为违规操作被调查呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are under investigation for misconduct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可东西都在飞机上了 你还要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}The package is on-board. What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh. Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我观察到热反应了 班吉 引擎开始发动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm reading a heat bloom, Benji. The engines are starting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm aware of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在连上卫星之前 我什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't do anything until I'm connected to the satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 班吉 连上了 - 好 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Benji, you are connected. - Okay, Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西还在那架飞机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The package is still on that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉燃料泵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut down the fuel pump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.71,0:02:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械控制系统都被锁死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh. Mechanical are lockdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那电子控制系统呢 - 噢 那倒是可能会有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the electrical system? - Oh, that might work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 液压系统 - 好 我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hydraulics. - Okay, standby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 被加密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're encrypted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 飞机要起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 东西还在上面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! The package is on the plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把舱门打开么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you open the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森你在哪里 - 我就在飞机旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan? Where are you? - I'm by the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 你能把舱门打开么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, can you open the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.47,0:03:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能把舱门打开 也许可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh. Can I open the door? Uh. Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我给你信号 你就把舱门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door when I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在飞机上了 快点开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on the plane. Open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么进到飞机里去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在飞机里面 我是在飞机上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the plane, I'm on the plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji. Open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是 是 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah-yeah-yeah… Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 班吉 现在立刻把门打开 - 我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Benji, open that door right now! - Yeah, I am trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点啊 班吉 - 班吉 快点开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Benji. - Benji, open that door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 加油 加油啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 很好 搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Yes, got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the wrong door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 不是那扇门 是另外一扇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, not that door. The other door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一扇 好的 另一扇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other door. Right. Yes, the other door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 是 对不起 我的错 我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yes, yes. Sorry, sorry. My bad, my bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我要把跳伞门打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Look, I'm gonna open the para-door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要打烊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会待很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么特别想买的碟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looking for anything in particular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常少见的碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something rare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,古典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jazz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨克斯风 - 柯川演奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sax. - Coltrane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钢琴呢 - 蒙克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Piano. - Monk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝斯手魅影·威尔逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shadow Wilson on the bass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,魅影·威尔逊是鼓手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shadow Wilson played drums.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么要叫他魅影吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know why they called him Shadow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他的鼓点轻柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he had a light touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你运气很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这有一张首发版唱片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've a first pressing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是你本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过你的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会都是真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't all be true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 亨特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good even, Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从白俄罗斯带回的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weapons you recovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经被确认是VX神经毒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Belarus were confirmed to be VX nerve gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:08:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,其威力足以摧毁一座大型城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capable of devastating a major city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在飞机降落于大马士革之后不到24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bodies of the air crew were found less than{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就找到了机组人员的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}24 hours after they landed in Damascus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,经确认他们的身份为普通车臣独立武装分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were identified as low level Chechen separatist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们并没有能力或权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}With neither the access nor the ability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触他们运送的这些武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}to acquire the weapons they were transporting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也印证了你之前的怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would support your suspicion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个秘密组织在那些对西方利益集团交好的国家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a shadow organization is committed to inciting revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过恐怖主义行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}By enabling acts of terror{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来煽动革命\N{\fnArial\fs30}in nations friendly to Western interests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,碟中谍小组怀疑这个组织与你去年一直在追查的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}IMF suspects this to be the same shadow organization{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是同一个秘密组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have been tracking for the last year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.01,0:08:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是所谓的辛迪加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also known as the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.39,0:08:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,碟中谍小组猜对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}IMF would be right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常情况下 你和你的组员会被派去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally, you and your team would be tasked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.07,0:08:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,渗透并摧毁这个恐怖分子网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}with infiltrating and disrupting this terrorist network, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们已经采取措施确保这不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have taken steps to ensure that this will not happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们就是辛迪加 亨特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, we, are the Syndicate, Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在我们也知道你的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以选择是否接受你的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission, should you choose to accept it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是直面你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to face your fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续追查我们 你会被抓住 跟我们做对 你就会被干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pursue us, you'll be caught. Resist us, you'll be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你敬重的部长大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you precious Secretary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不会承认任何与你行动有关的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}will disavow any knowledge of your actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 亨特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个留言会在五秒中后自毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This message will self destruct in 5 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairman, the IMF's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:09:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,碟中谍小组的违规行为都可以追溯到我刚到中央情报局的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}misadventures date back to my earliest days in the CIA{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他们潜入中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the IMF broke into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃取我们的一份秘密特工名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}the CIA to steal a list of covert operatives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最近 居然搞起了一枚俄罗斯弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, more recently a Russian warhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是解除了危险的俄罗斯弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disarmed Russian warhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一枚俄罗斯核弹头 - 碟中谍小组出手 安全保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A Russian nuclear warhead. - Branded safe by the IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在其掉落进旧金山湾之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clipped the Transamerica Pyramid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,从泛美金字塔上砸穿了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}before plunging into the San Francisco bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,西岸的空气质量幸免于难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving the western atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这一切的起因 都是因为碟中谍小组的特工故意将\N{\fnArial\fs30}This made possible by IMF agents who did willing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹发射密码透漏给一个恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}provide the launch codes to a known terrorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说对了吗 勃兰特特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have that right, agent Brandt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没有获得部长的许可之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can neither confirm nor deny details{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既不能承认也不能否认这些行动的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}of any such operation without Secretary's approval.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在同一周内 碟中谍小组还潜入了克里姆林宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the same week after IMF infiltrated the Kremlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是潜入前的克里姆林宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the Kremlin before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是之后的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Kremlin after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既不能承认也不能否认这些行动的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can neither confirm nor deny details of any operation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没有获得部长的许可之前 是的 我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the Secretary's approval. Yes, we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 在陪审团任命一位新的部长之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, until this panel appoints a new Secretary, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能跟我们透露任何事情 对吧 勃兰特特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really can't say much of anything, can you, agent Brandt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我定的规矩 亨利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. I didn't write the rules, Mr. Hunley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席先生 这个所谓的碟中谍小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairman, the so call Impossible Missions Force{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅肆意妄为 而且观念过时\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not just a rogue organization, it is an outdated one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:11:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就像一个体制没有透明公开和监管不利时代的产物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A throwback to an era without transparency and without oversight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主席先生 - 是时候解散碟中谍小组了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Chairman. - The time has come to dissolve the IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主席先生 - 然后把其资源和人员调拨给中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Chairman. - And transfer the salvageable assets to the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairman, the IMF has{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,碟中谍小组这四十年来都在没有监管的情况下运作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}operated without oversight for 40 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它的方式是不是不正规呢 是的 - 主席先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, are its methods unorthodox? Yes. - Mr. Chairman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果是不是有时也不尽完美呢 当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are its results less than perfect? Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有碟中谍小组 我们只好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But without the IMF, to be force…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会有稳定和秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be order and stability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有碟中谍小组…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the IMF…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪审团认可碟中谍小组对于国际安全的贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}This panel recognizes the IMF's contribution to global security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是中情局局长亨利所举出的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the events laid out by CIA director Hunley{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实揭露了你们蓄意铤而走险的边缘政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}also show a pattern of once and brinkmanship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有对政策协议的完全无视\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a total disregard for protocol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From where I sit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不合规定的行动方式和冒险没有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}you unorthodox methods are indistinguishable from chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而结果 无论好还是坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your results, perfect or not, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来更像是在赌运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}looked suspiciously like luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今天恐怕就是碟中谍小组运气用光的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid today is the day when the IMF's luck runs out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What are you doing here?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇他看上你什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he see in you, I wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看你到底是不是铁打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see what is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不你帮我解开手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take off the cuffs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你见识见识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,文特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vinter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.53,0:14:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾尼克·文特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janik Vinter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也叫你 骨科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call you, the bone doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The funny thing is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方三年前就宣布你死亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're officially declared dead, 3 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 鞋子不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shoes by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到的指示是跟他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have instructions to talk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人开口的方式因人而异\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are men who can be broken in different ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是个硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's a fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你策反他之前 他宁可去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll die, before you turn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在担心他会取代你的位置对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you worry he's gonna take your place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先走吧 等会儿场面会很难看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go, before it gets ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.63,0:15:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就来看看你到底有多难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's see how tough you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 贾尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you, Janik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前并没有见过 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never met before, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在搞什么 - 我不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What're you doing? - I can't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你不能留下 我们刚杀了那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. You can't stay. We just killed those men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们杀的 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't kill them. You did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着阻止你 你却逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to stop you. You got away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在最好赶紧走 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hurry now. Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往北边通道去了 还把门关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading towards north passage. He has closed the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追 他就要跑远了 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run. He's getting away. Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:18:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七号通信栈 - 西欧 非加密线路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stack-com 7. - Western Europe unsecured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.65,0:18:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 代码 - BE11\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Designator. - Bravo Echo One One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connecting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是勃兰特 - 线路加密\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Brandt. - Go secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦分支遭遇入侵 重复 伦敦分支遭遇入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}London terminal is compromised. Repeat, London is compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工据点已经沦陷 请求允许立即撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent placed is down. Request immediate extraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事情 是谁攻破了伦敦分支\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? Who breached London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可以追查下去的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you've anything to go on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到那人的脸了 他想要东西 但不是信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}A face. He wanted something. Not information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本可以杀了我 可是他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could've kill me, but he didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 你觉得那意味着什么 - 辛迪加是真实存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, what do you think it means. - The Syndicate is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我们的真实身份 我们如何执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know who we're, how we operate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道为什么追查他们会那么难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know why they've been so hard to find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽可能的搜集所有能查到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just focus operations on gathering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,前秘密特工信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}any available Intel regarding formal covert operatives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是哪个国家或者机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what country or agency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要查死亡 或者是推测死亡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as long as they are dead Or presumed dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.51,0:18:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从贾尼克·文特入手 他也被叫做骨科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with Janik Vinter. He's also known as the bone doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没法查了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't do that. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.61,0:18:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会关闭了行动组\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Committee has shut us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:19:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的行动都被移交给了中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operations are to be handled over to the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,碟中谍小组已经不复存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no more IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被命令召回所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been ordered to bring everyone in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森 - 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan. - I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森 - 我明白 勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan. - I understand, Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.91,0:19:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当我们从来没有过刚才的对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't have this conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.89,0:19:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在伦敦消失了 你不知道我去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disappeared in London. You don't know where I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知道我是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm dead or alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到的那个人 你能找到他么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man you saw. Can you find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不找到他我是不会罢休的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't stop until I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很有可能是我们的最后一次任务了 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may very well be our last mission, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们很快就要开始共事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since we are going to be work together, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能慎重地回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to choose your next words very carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 别对我撒谎 勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Don't lie to me, Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本联系不上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no way of contacting him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:20:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他潜伏的很深 最后一次得到消息是 他在追查辛迪加\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's deep cover. Last I heard, he's tracking the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开门见山地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's cut the bull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚我们是谁 也很明白我们的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who we are. You know what we are capable of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这个辛迪加\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come the CIA has never{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局怎么可能从没发现任何可靠情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}discovered any actual Intel regarding this Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想暗示什么 - 不是暗示 是陈述\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you implying? - Not implying, stating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.87,0:20:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实也在提出一个指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leveling an accusation actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.16,0:20:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特扮演着纵火犯和消防员的双重身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt is both arsonist and fireman at the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信辛迪加只是他靠想象所捏造出来的产物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that the Syndicate is a figment of his imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来证明碟中谍小组存在的必要性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Created to justify the IMF's existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到他 勃兰特 到那个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to find him, Brandt. And when I do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会让他为他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will be called upon to answer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次蓄意破坏的行动负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}for every wanton active mayhem he's responsible for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.09,0:20:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都找不到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧 勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set your watch, Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特没几天自由自在的日子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt is living his last day as a free man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家 注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody. Heads up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是今天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法队准备好了 随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha team prep. Standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 执行吧 - 执行小队 开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Execute. - Langley brimstone, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再重复一次 开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say again. We are a go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 这里没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Langley, there's nobody here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.37,0:22:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,执行小队 镜头对向北面的墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Langley brimstone. Face the north wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个在此消失的是航班606\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one vanishes here is flight 606?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,战火再燃 化学武器要上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire guts chemical weapons plant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界银行宣布出现危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}World bank declares crisis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dunn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又到那个的时间了吗 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it that time already. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会问你一组比照问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to ask you a series of control questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.40,0:23:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 也会诚实的回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know and I'm gonna answer truthfully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你还会问我一些让我故意撒谎的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you gonna ask me to lie intentionally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.66,0:23:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的名字是 - 挪威的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}- State your name. - The King of Norway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.27,0:23:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧 这就是撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.63,0:23:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我是王位的第三顺位继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually third in line to the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的哥哥是\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.09,0:23:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森·亨特跟你联系过么 - 他为什么要联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has Ethan Hunt contacted you? - Why would he contact me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特重新露面了 这次在古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt has resurfaced. This time in Cuba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.45,0:23:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 留下了这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}He… left these behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.72,0:23:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你怎么看这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you make of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 他开始玩剪贴薄了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. He's taken up scrap booking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些照片 邓恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the photographs, Dunn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.74,0:24:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人要么失踪要么死了 每一个都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them are either missing or dead, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.63,0:24:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全部都曾经是政府特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them were government agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.26,0:24:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯 法国 英国 以色列 你能叫出名字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian, French, British, Israelis, you name it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.30,0:24:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些文件都是高度机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are highly classified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是亨特却毫不费力的就搜集到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}files and yet Hunt had no problem collecting them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.59,0:24:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他好像总是比我们要快一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he always seems to be a step ahead of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在想这是为什么 - 你是在暗示我在帮他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wonder how? - Are you suggesting I'm helping him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.05,0:24:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确有过这个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thought had cross my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.27,0:24:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月以来 我一直待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}6 months, I have been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.00,0:24:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,筛选堆积如山的元数据和百兆位编码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sifting through mountains of metadata and exabytes of encoded excrement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.05,0:24:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我破解 处理 分析的数据是我们部门最多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had decrypted, processed, passed more data than anyone in my section.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.12,0:24:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而每周 你都把我带到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet every week, you hold me in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,换着各种方式 问我同一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you ask me the same question, just in a different way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.07,0:24:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而今天 你并没有回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today, you haven't answered it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总觉得 某种程度上 我对他还有义务和责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to thinks I have some kind of obligation to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.22,0:24:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但实际上 并不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, nothing could be further from the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.77,0:24:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特依旧在逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt is still out there in the field, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.82,0:24:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我却被困在这里要对他的所作所为负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am stuck here answering for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.65,0:24:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.72,0:25:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不欠他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe him nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.57,0:25:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就到此为止吧 邓恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be all, Dunn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到维也纳 班吉 有想念我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Vienna, Benji. Missed me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森你在哪儿 你到底死到哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, where are you? Where the hell have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.99,0:26:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有行踪 算了 拜托 别告诉我啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No act… you know what? Please, don't tell me that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.18,0:26:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我在每周的例行测谎中又要多说一个谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's just another thing I would have to lie about in my weekly polygraph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.17,0:26:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不必担心 继续往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is going to be fine. Just keep walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 要确保你没有被跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, make sure you're not being followed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.69,0:26:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这些歌剧门票不是我中奖赢的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I didn't win those opera tickets, did I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.28,0:26:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 恐怕不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm afraid not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.99,0:26:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么我们去哪儿见面 - 我们不见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, where do we meet? - We don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.69,0:26:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你着想 不能让人看到我们在一起见过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your sake, we shouldn't be seen together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.65,0:26:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一封邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have mail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.34,0:26:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是谁 - 我们来这里要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is he? - That's what we're here to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.17,0:26:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 他是我们探查辛迪加的唯一线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do know, is he's our only possible link to the Syndicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.32,0:26:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我有理由相信 他今晚也会出现在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have reason to believe that he's going to be here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.32,0:26:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一个人找不到他 你要入伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't find him alone. Are you in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.53,0:26:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要不要入伙 - 当然 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you in? - Yes, of course. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.89,0:26:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 计划是什么 - 很简单 你找到他 我们跟踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what's the play? - Simple. You find him, we tag him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.38,0:26:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会对他紧追不舍 - 在这之后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I follow him wherever he goes. - And after that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.30,0:26:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后你周一早上飞回去上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that you're on a plane, back at work Monday morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.39,0:26:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神不知鬼不觉 - 什么 这就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one is the wiser. - What? That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.72,0:27:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的处境已经够危险的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in enough danger as it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.32,0:27:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本不想把你卷进来 可惜我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to involve you this much but I had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.93,0:27:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你都让我卷入这一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. If you're gonna bring me all this way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少安排点更… 刺激的剧情\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could at least give me something a little be more…you know, dramatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.35,0:27:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 我们都要努力保持低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, we are trying to keep a low profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.36,0:27:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想来点刺激的剧情 去看歌剧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want drama, go to the opera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.66,0:27:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以看到我眼前的这一切吗 - 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you seeing what I'm seeing? - Yes, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜那位就是奥地利总理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I correct in assuming that is the Chancellor of Austria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.04,0:28:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回答正确 - 你知道他会来这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you are. - Did you know he's going to be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.56,0:28:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.25,0:28:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这里来了位欧洲国家的元首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. We have a European Heads of State here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.59,0:28:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时 我们在搜捕一个穷凶极恶的恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the same time as we're looking for a nefarious terrorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.13,0:28:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我相信这两者毫无联系 - 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I'm sure the two things are completely unrelated. - Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.69,0:28:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而同时 我还得努力忘掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile I'll try and overlook the fact that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.15,0:28:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你正被中情局全球通缉的事实 - 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you're an international fugitive wanted by the CIA. - Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有这次未经批准的行动可能会被定性为叛国 - 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And this little unsanctioned operation is tenemented treasonous. - Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.23,0:28:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为就像你之前说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because as you stated earlier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.57,0:28:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,周一早上我还得回到办公桌前打游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be back in my desk on Monday morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.41,0:28:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一切神不知鬼不觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing video games and no one will be any be the wiser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.33,0:28:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 演出快开始了 班吉 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The show's about to start, Benji. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先去找个位子 告诉我发现了什么 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just take your position, tell me what you see. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.95,0:28:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 礼服很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice tux, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.79,0:28:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞台就位 灯光准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stage is set. Ready lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.18,0:28:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.83,0:29:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后准备就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The final preparations ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.62,0:29:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay alert, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.63,0:29:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入碟中谍小组 监控全球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join the IMF. See the world, on a monitor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.13,0:29:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然是在储藏室\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a closet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.71,0:30:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞定监视器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I have eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.05,0:30:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searching{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.39,0:31:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汇报情况 班吉 - 没有进展 待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talk to me, Benji. - Nothing yet. Standby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.22,0:31:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在这儿 到底在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're here. Where're you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.18,0:31:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森有点状况 不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh Ethan, I might have something for you. Can't confirm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪儿 - 后台 我给你指路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Backstage, I will direct you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.65,0:32:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入你左手边的门 他应该处于你的正前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the door on your left. He should be right in front of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.76,0:32:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 班吉 你看到了吗 - 看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Benji, did you see that? - See what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.25,0:32:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.48,0:32:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么女人 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What woman? Where're you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.26,0:32:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.58,0:35:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么情况 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I don't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.07,0:35:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森能听见吗 伊森 请回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, do you copy? Ethan, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.46,0:37:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森注意灯光控制室 伊森能听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, the lighting booth. Ethan, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.82,0:37:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的天啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.82,0:39:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是轻伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a flash wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.88,0:40:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.26,0:40:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁这栋建筑 守住所有出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surround the building. Secure the exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.48,0:40:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法出去 有兴趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've a way out. Interested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.41,0:40:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,带路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.11,0:40:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有话要告诉我的吗 - 现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything you want to tell me? - No, not right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.47,0:40:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能跟得上吗 - 不用等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's the pace? - Don't wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.51,0:40:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.77,0:40:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.80,0:40:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:40:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.90,0:41:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我鞋子脱了 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.74,0:41:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你出了什么事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happens to you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.19,0:42:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么事也不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is going to happen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.42,0:42:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.22,0:42:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.40,0:42:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.01,0:42:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠 她刚才拿枪指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… She tried to shoot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.71,0:42:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不代表她就是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make her a bad person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.50,0:42:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我恐怕必须要搜一下你的身 - 你必须得放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna have to search you. - You have to let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.15,0:42:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这可没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh oh. Not a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.70,0:42:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你的职责是留守伦敦 现在你好像有点越界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you're deep cover back in London but isn't this taking the role a little too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.36,0:42:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,先等等 你认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on a minute, you know her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.79,0:42:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没有正式地自我介绍过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. We haven't formerly introduced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.69,0:42:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确定她是英国特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am pretty sure she's British intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.11,0:42:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎·福斯特 你是伊森·亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa Faust. You're Ethan Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.07,0:42:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这个颜色的唇膏可是很难买到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… that shade is very hard to find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.07,0:42:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今晚在歌剧院干什么 - 除了暗杀总理还有别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What were you doing at the opera tonight? - What? Aside from killing the Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.24,0:42:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伦敦救你的事 让我陷入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving your life in London put me in a tight spot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.57,0:42:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常危险的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some very dangerous people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.42,0:43:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奉命前来刺杀总理 以重新赢得他们的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sent to kill the Chancellor to regain their trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.92,0:43:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你承认刺杀他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha. So, you admit that you killed him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.64,0:43:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想装个样子 不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went through the motion, that's not the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.80,0:43:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本想让总理受伤住院 以此来救他一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you put him in the hospital, take him out of harm's way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.87,0:43:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你打算做的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same thing you tried to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.58,0:43:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会就这样相信她吧 那她的同伙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna believe that, are you? What about the rest of her team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.03,0:43:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指那两个蠢货 他们只是替补人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You means those other 2 idiots? I can only assumed they were redundancies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.91,0:43:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防你没有奉命行事 一个人负责暗杀总理\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you didn't follow through. One man to kill the Chancellor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个杀了你 这是一个考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other one to kill you. A test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.67,0:43:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏你 我没能杀了第二个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second one I failed, thanks to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.59,0:43:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而汽车炸弹则是最后的杀手锏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the car bomb was insurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.85,0:43:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被人追踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.26,0:43:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.12,0:43:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在追查同一个目标 而我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're after the same thing, and I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.30,0:43:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想打败辛迪加 你必须放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to bring down the Syndicate, you've to let me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.22,0:43:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're closing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.11,0:43:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须看上去像是落荒而逃的 所以 快把我随便扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to look like an escape. So, you just throw me out anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.76,0:43:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.24,0:43:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划有变 把她扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Change of plan. Throw her out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.86,0:44:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有足够的信息能找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have everything you need to find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.94,0:44:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们审问班吉·邓恩关于伊森·亨特的事宜之后不到24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less than 24 hours after we interviewed Benji Dunn about Ethan Hunt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.95,0:44:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就带着门票飞去维也纳歌剧院\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was on a plane to Vienna with tickets to the opera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.51,0:44:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抵达剧院之后还不到六小时 总理遇刺身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And within 6 hours of his arrival, the Chancellor was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.81,0:44:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对普通人来说 这可能只是偶然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that might be circumstance to some public defendant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.27,0:44:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对中情局探员来说 这代表着行动情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to the CIA, that is actionable intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.40,0:44:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一种情况 他可能是为调查伊森才去的剧院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider the moment, the possibility that Ethan's investigation lead him to the opera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.93,0:44:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且他手中有这次行动的相关情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's the one with the actionable intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.61,0:44:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 抓捕亨特不能再是小打小闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, finding Hunt is no longer our pet project.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.79,0:44:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起 特别行动部门将拥有最高行事的特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Special Activity Division will now have full discretion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.68,0:44:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是允许就地处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean shoot to kill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.11,0:44:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特的生死取决于他自己的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether Hunt lives or dies. It's entirely up to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.37,0:45:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,新身份 护照 现金 地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}New identity, passport, cash, road map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.80,0:45:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,包里有替换衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a change of clothes in that bag, right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.40,0:46:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有能让你瞒天过海回到华盛顿总部的东西都在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you need to make it to DC undetected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.32,0:46:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那儿之后 你要立即告发我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you're there, you'll have to inform on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.91,0:46:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应该… 什么 - 坦白事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm suppose… what? Sorry, what? - Tell the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.90,0:46:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为自己中了两张歌剧门票才来的维也纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to Vienna believing you won 2 tickets to the opera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.88,0:46:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图劝诱你参与刺杀总理的行动 被你拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I attempted to recruit you into assassinating the Chancellor, you refused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.15,0:46:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是事实 - 你的死活取决于他们是否相信你所说的 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is not the true. - Your life depends on them believing you, Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.53,0:46:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺着他们的意思说 你更容易保住性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll go easier if you tell them what they want to hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.86,0:46:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 至少告诉我这一切到底是怎么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, at least tell me what this is all about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.67,0:46:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你认识的谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recognized anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.16,0:46:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他 - 沙特阿拉伯人 前德国特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Him. - He's former KSA, German intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.55,0:46:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪 推测已死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing, presumed dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.05,0:46:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是今晚剧院的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was at the opera tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.02,0:46:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.60,0:46:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 前以色列摩萨德特工 - 让我猜猜 推测已死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Former Mossad. - Let me guess. Presumed dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.14,0:46:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我已经亲手把它变成了事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, I made it official.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.51,0:47:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追着他去了博斯普鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for him in Bosporus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.01,0:47:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一天 前来访问的马拉维共和国总统死于车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same day a car accident killed the visiting President of Malawi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.73,0:47:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在雅加达 又被他逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slipped away again in Jakarta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.62,0:47:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此前几小时 一架客机在太平洋上空突然失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hours before a passenger plane vanished over the Pacific{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.67,0:47:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,机上共计236名乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}with 236 passengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.09,0:47:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我在菲律宾又跟丢了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just missed him in the Philippines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.06,0:47:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之后 一座石油化工厂失火 导致两千名村民毒气中毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right before a fired petrochemical plant gassed a village of 2, 000 people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.94,0:47:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这些事故之间有着某种联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying these accidents are somehow connected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.98,0:47:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那架失踪客机搭载着世界银行的总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That missing plane was carrying the Secretary of the World Bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.02,0:47:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那起火灾瓦解了一次全球军备合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}That fire bankcorrupted a global arms cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.23,0:47:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那起车祸引发了一场内战\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wreck triggered a civil war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.47,0:47:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些都绝非偶然\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are no accidents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.80,0:47:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们由某个组织策划 环环相扣 这些都是辛迪加的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're links in a chain. The work of a single organization, the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.27,0:47:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个像我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rogue nation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.57,0:47:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练有素的秘密组织 却别有用心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trained to do what we do. Inbuilt with a new sense of purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.70,0:47:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁现有秩序的制定者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy the system that created them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.05,0:47:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论挡路的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regardless if who's in the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.10,0:48:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,反派版的碟中谍小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}An anti-IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.46,0:48:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从亨利解散了我们部门后 这个组织就越加猖狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since Hunley shut us down, they've been escalating unchecked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.15,0:48:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚刺杀总统的行动 就是一个声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing the Chancellor tonight was a statement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.88,0:48:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣告一个新时代的开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The start of a new phase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.03,0:48:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者它们只是一系列偶发灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they could just be a series of random disasters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.31,0:48:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次都在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.98,0:48:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像今晚一样 我很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like he was there tonight. I'm sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.40,0:48:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他是谁 他来自哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who he is, or where he's from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.95,0:48:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受谁资助\N{\fnArial\fs30}How he's funded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.94,0:48:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道他是一切的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know he's the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.07,0:48:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 这就是我加入的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, this is what I sign up for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.61,0:48:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来帮你找到他 - 这就是为什么我带你来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me help you find him. - That's why I brought you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.96,0:48:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最初的目的 但看看都发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first place. And look what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.40,0:48:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保护不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.21,0:48:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我需要你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I need you to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.19,0:48:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无权决定 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your decision to make, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.44,0:48:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是外勤特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a field agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.06,0:48:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这里面的风险 更重要的是 我还是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the risks. More than that, I'm your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.93,0:48:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我… 每周对测谎仪说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what I… tell the polygraph every week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.98,0:48:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我过来 因为你需要我的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you called me because you needed my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.95,0:48:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你仍然需要 所以我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you still do. So, I'm staying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.18,0:49:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事 我们就这么说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all we're gonna say about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.95,0:49:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay - Good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.00,0:49:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从哪开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we start?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.32,0:49:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.97,0:49:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们怎么找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. And how do we find her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.64,0:49:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说过用我们手中的东西可以找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said we've everything we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.55,0:50:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有过协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had an agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.71,0:50:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派给我的任务 我会去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You send me to do a job, I'd do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.59,0:50:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是得按我的办法来 不是你的 - 我什么时候违约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But my way, not yours. - When did I deviate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.56,0:50:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你另外派了两个杀手进剧院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put 2 more gunman at the opera tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.75,0:50:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个试图杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them try to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.40,0:50:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你失手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.54,0:50:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失手是因为伊森·亨特在那儿找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed because Ethan Hunt was there looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.16,0:50:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特能来维也纳是因为你在伦敦放走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt is in Vienna because you allow him escape in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.66,0:50:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伦敦 文特要杀了他 这违背了你的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vinter would've kill him in London and that's not what you asked for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.82,0:50:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你已经两次让他逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice now you've let him slipped away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.96,0:50:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是奇怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.37,0:50:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在质疑我的忠诚 还是我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you questioning my loyalty or my ability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.87,0:50:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很难说 - 我之前告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't decide. - I've told you before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.11,0:50:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 不然就杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me or kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.33,0:50:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过如果你要杀我 堂堂正正的来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're going to kill me, be the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.36,0:50:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲自动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.27,0:51:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他同你说了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.52,0:51:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他知道摩洛哥 - 他知道摩洛哥的什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He knows about Morocco. - What did he know about Morocco?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.39,0:51:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道那个发电站 但不知道里面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows about the power plant. He doesn't know what's in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.07,0:51:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就拜托你找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find him, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.83,0:51:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.60,0:51:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经让他看到那个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've him seen to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.42,0:51:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's interesting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.81,0:51:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里面是什么 - 是敏感信息隔离设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - It's a SCIF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.54,0:51:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护离线状态下的电脑设备 超大容量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure Computer Facility offline, ultra-contained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.40,0:51:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能从外部入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impossible to hack in from the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.52,0:51:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上就像一个数据保险柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's essentially a digital safety deposit box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.09,0:51:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪一名年轻女士会带着这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very strange thing for a young lady to be carrying in her sundries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.78,0:51:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它在哪儿 - 摩洛哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's it located? - Morocco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.39,0:52:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩洛哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morocco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.59,0:53:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,绅士们 是什么风把你们吹到了卡萨布兰卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what brings you gentlemen to Casablanca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.95,0:53:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真高兴见到你 - 有什么事不能在电话里告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to see you - What couldn't you tell me over the telephone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.30,0:53:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥地利总理被刺杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chancellor of Austria was assassinated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.25,0:54:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为伊森和班吉也在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe that Ethan and Benji were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.16,0:54:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利把这件事交给特别行动小组处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huntley's handed this over to Special Activities Division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.18,0:54:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要赶在他们之前找到伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find Ethan before they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.78,0:54:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's where you come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.54,0:54:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没兴趣 - 听我说 卢瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not interested. - Okay. Look, Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.56,0:54:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 伙计 我了解伊森 但我不了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man. I know Ethan. I don't know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.13,0:54:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道你最后选择为亨利工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know about you is that you chose to work for Hunley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.14,0:54:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也只知道你最后选择了辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all I know about you is you chose to resign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.79,0:54:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用替伊森担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.54,0:54:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们永远也抓不到他 - 不 他们不是要去抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They'll never catch him - No, they're not going to catch him. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.62,0:54:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是中情局 我们在说的是亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the CIA, this is Hunley we're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.01,0:54:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况已经失控了 他们要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing are out of control and they're going to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.99,0:54:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去干掉伊森和班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to kill Ethan. They're going to kill Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.40,0:54:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须抢先找到他们 你愿意来帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get to them first. Are you going to help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.64,0:54:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事你要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to understand something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.12,0:54:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan is my friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.99,0:55:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我对你的立场产生了哪怕一秒钟的怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I have 1 second of doubt whose side you're on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.80,0:55:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.86,0:55:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alright. - Alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.91,0:55:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在我们手上有什么 - 不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do I have to go on? - Not much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.36,0:55:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间也不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not a lot of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.88,0:55:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫所罗门·莱恩 是他创立了辛迪加\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Solomon Lane. He created the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.80,0:55:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有什么来头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.27,0:55:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是前英国特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's former British intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.34,0:55:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果英国情报局知道辛迪加的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. If British intelligence knows the Syndicate exist, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.88,0:55:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不直接通知中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't they just tell the CIA?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.09,0:55:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们不想让人知道 是自己人创立了辛迪加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they don't want anyone knowing the Syndicate was created by one of their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.65,0:55:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被秘密派遣来获得莱恩的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sent undercover to earn Lane's trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.51,0:55:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且最终指认这个组织的成员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And eventually identifying the members of his organization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.79,0:55:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是两年来第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in 2 years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.32,0:55:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就快要探查出他们的身份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm close to knowing who they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.81,0:55:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩有一份账册 详细记录了执行人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane had a ledger. It contain the identities of his operatives, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.38,0:55:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,和恐怖分子合伙人的身份 以及辛迪加内部运作情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}his terrorist associates, the entire inner workings of the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.36,0:56:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个特工偷走了账册 并试图敲诈他\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of his agents stole it hoping to blackmail him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.57,0:56:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把账册放在一个戒备森严的电脑设备里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept it in a secure computer facility for safe keeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.70,0:56:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在拷问密码的时候 他被人失手打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died being interrogated for the access code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.50,0:56:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,留给了莱恩一个大的隐患\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving Lane with a serious problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.49,0:56:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以打垮莱恩的重要证据就被放在一个电脑里 任人来取吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the key to crushing Lane is sitting in a computer just waiting for someone to take it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.37,0:56:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么为什么莱恩不派个人来偷走账册\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why hasn't Lane just send someone to steal it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.22,0:56:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经派来了 就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he has. He sent me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.80,0:56:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我能告诉你的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.58,0:56:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个不可能完成的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.01,0:56:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个设备被藏在本地发电厂的地底 周围有军队守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The facility is hidden beneath the local power plant under military guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.60,0:56:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,下载这个账册的唯一方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only way to download the ledger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.48,0:56:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是通过那地方的中央计算机终端\N{\fnArial\fs30}is through the central computer terminal, located there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.80,0:56:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要抵达这个终端计算机 你需要通过几扇设施大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}To reach the terminal, you'll need to pass the main gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.83,0:56:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入搭载装有指纹识别系统的电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access the elevator with fingerprint recognition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.84,0:56:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后分别打开三个组合密码锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And open 3 separate combination locks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.27,0:57:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单 我们可以伪装成最初偷走账册的那个特工就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's easy. We just impersonate the agent who stole the ledger in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.42,0:57:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带上面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… I get to wear a mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.28,0:57:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不巧地是 即使你可以骗过其他安全检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, even if you can make it through every other security measure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.49,0:57:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗不了最后一关\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't beat the last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.04,0:57:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它使用的是步态分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because it's protected by gait analysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.33,0:57:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比面部识别更加先进\N{\fnArial\fs30}A step beyond facial recognition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.57,0:57:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些监控知道那个特工如何行走\N{\fnArial\fs30}These cameras actually know how the agent walks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.37,0:57:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何说话 如何动作 甚至包括面部肌肉活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}how he talks, how he moves, right down to his facial takes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.06,0:57:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说面具骗不了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what you're saying is, no mask can beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.08,0:57:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们到达地下室之前就会被识破\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're busted before we could even get into the vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.51,0:57:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会被送进摩洛哥监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lwind up in a Moroccan jail, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.97,0:58:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辈子尽情地玩过家家的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing mummies and daddies with Ahmad the Strangler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.67,0:58:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我放弃面具了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I don't get to wear a mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.77,0:58:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有其他途径进入电脑室了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And there's no other way into the computer lab? - No other way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.74,0:58:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 通风口呢 - 管道直径只有六英寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Air shaft? - 6 inch diameter pipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.12,0:58:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地基呢 - 混凝土厚达十二英尺 上下都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Foundation? - 12 feet of concrete, top and bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.77,0:58:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 电缆导管呢 - 这是底线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Electrical conduit? - Bottom line is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.47,0:58:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想进入终端\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no way into that terminal unless{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.16,0:58:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非把你的个人资料提前存入安全系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}your profile is pre-installed in the security system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.90,0:58:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,个人资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Profile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.12,0:58:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,个人资料被存放在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where're the profile stored?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.66,0:58:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的安全数据被存放在离线的液体冷却装置里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All security data is stored offline in the liquid cooler aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.80,0:58:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 圆环体里面有液体冷却剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, inside the torus, liquid cooled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.88,0:58:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说那东西在水下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean that thing is under water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.81,0:58:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.99,0:58:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.09,0:58:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 要想拿到账册 必须有一个人进入那个圆环体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, to get the ledger, one of us needs to enter the torus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.80,0:58:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,替换掉其中安全资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}and change the security profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.79,0:58:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样另一个人就能顺利接触到电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that the other one can access the computer without being caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.05,0:58:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是唯一的方法 - 这就是唯一的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the only way. - That's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.96,0:58:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能从那儿进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get in through there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.22,0:58:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 那是服务舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - That's the service hatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.47,0:59:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只能从内部打开 否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can only be opened from the inside. If you try and open it from the outside, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.04,0:59:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被七万加仑的高压水流击中\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be hit with 70, 000 gallons of pressurized water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.43,0:59:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 水流来自哪里 - 由进水口引入的淡化海水\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where does the water come from? - Desalinized seawater flows through the intake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.74,0:59:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,储备在这个管道中 顺便告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the pipeline. And before you ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.10,0:59:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果检测到任何金属物体进入进水口 系统就会自动关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system is designed to shut down automatically if any metal enters the intake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.46,0:59:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能用氧气罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No oxygen tanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.39,0:59:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 从进水口自由潜泳到服务舱门需要多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Well, how long will it take to free swim from the intake to the service hatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.88,0:59:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟 在最佳情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 minutes. With the current at full power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.17,0:59:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你只需要闭气两分钟就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. Then, you just have to hold your breath for 2 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.80,0:59:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 替换安全资料的时间呢 - 这个用最多一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about installing the security profile? - Well. That's gonna be like a minute tops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.69,0:59:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我得在水下憋气三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I have to hold my breath for 3 minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.59,0:59:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你可以做到的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.87,0:59:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你忽略了这个运动带来的体力消耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think you're overlooking, is the physical exertion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.12,0:59:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的动作越激烈 你的氧气消耗就越快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more you exert yourself, the faster you consume oxygen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.26,0:59:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心他 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about him. Alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.78,0:59:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要在我进入步态分析之前 把伪造的档案导入就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he has to do is install the fake profile before I get to the gait analysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.50,0:59:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说的 这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it yourself, it's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.92,0:59:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不是不可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't sound impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.60,0:59:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星监控覆盖了整个地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite over-watch covering all 7 continents, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.39,1:00:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,DNA检测 脸部识别 无人侦察机和无人轰炸机\N{\fnArial\fs30}DNA profiling, facial recognition, drone surveillance, drone strikes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.64,1:00:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我 要怎么在他们之前找到伊森和班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how are we suppose to find Ethan and Benji before they do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.48,1:00:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本就不用找他们 要找的是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even looking for them. I'm looking for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.36,1:00:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.64,1:00:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些素描 你能看出什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These sketches, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.44,1:00:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森自己也不清楚这人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan's not exactly sure who this guys is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.09,1:00:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个女人 他认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this woman, he knows her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.68,1:00:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森很信任她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He trust her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.53,1:00:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他还没和这个女人在一起的话 那现在肯定还在找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm betting that if he's not already with her, he's on his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.19,1:00:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她 就能找到伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find her, find Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.73,1:00:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能看一眼面部素描就找到那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me it's possible to pull facial recognition of a sketch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.20,1:00:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对大多数人来说是不可能 但我在家里就能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}For mere mortals, no. For me, I could've done this at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.31,1:00:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.01,1:00:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要找多久 - 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long is this going to take? - Found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.13,1:00:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萨布兰卡机场的监控拍到了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}CCTV picked her up at the airport in Casablanca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.24,1:00:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.15,1:00:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下棘手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.14,1:01:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请出示通行证 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Card. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.01,1:01:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的通行证无效 - 班吉 我们进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your card is not working. - Benji, we're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.83,1:02:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.89,1:02:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次 你只有三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time. You have 3 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.09,1:02:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分半时间用来调包安全档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}2.5 minutes to switch the security profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.25,1:02:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下半分钟从服务舱口逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 seconds to escape through the service hatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.38,1:02:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 节省氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, conserve oxygen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.38,1:03:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,水下别做多余的动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move a muscle if you don't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.52,1:03:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进电梯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,水流会把你带进圆环\N{\fnArial\fs30}That current will carry you to a torus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.19,1:03:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一到那儿 我就会关闭进水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you're there, I'll shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.67,1:03:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,友情提示 档案放在108号箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Important note. The profile is in slot 108.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.51,1:03:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再稍微提醒一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a slightly more important note, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.57,1:03:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我到达步态分析之前 你没有调包档案的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you haven't switched that profile before I reach the gait analysis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.52,1:03:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.88,1:03:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢提醒 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.99,1:05:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 冷却系统自动重启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the problem? - The cooling system is rebooting by itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.91,1:06:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统恢复正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All systems' normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.62,1:06:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷却系统开始运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooling systems at full power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.55,1:06:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-no-no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.85,1:10:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alright. You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.56,1:10:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我说什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}See. What did I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.28,1:10:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实困难 但也不是不可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difficult, absolutely, but certainly not impossible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.82,1:10:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 他没事吧 他怎么了 发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, is he alright? What happened? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.21,1:10:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.03,1:10:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.44,1:10:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错怪你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I misjudged you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.66,1:10:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你还好吗 感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. Hey. You okay? How're you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.20,1:10:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.54,1:10:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 班吉 - 嗯 我是班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Benji. - Yes, it's Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.75,1:10:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.32,1:10:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先喘口气 好吗 歇一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take a moment, alright. Just-Just take a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.35,1:10:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这里没有阳光和新鲜的空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing a little sunshine and fresh air won't fix you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.80,1:11:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你肯定会没事的 - 你在这里干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll be as right as rain. - What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.92,1:11:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look-look-look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.79,1:11:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.25,1:11:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道我们会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew we'll get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.02,1:11:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不想说些不好听的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I don't want to sound ungrateful, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.70,1:11:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感谢你所做的一切 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate everything you do for me, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.67,1:11:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 你会玩火自焚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of these days, you're gonna take it too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.00,1:11:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.85,1:11:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要逮住那个… 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna nail that… Ehh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.78,1:11:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.93,1:11:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说你能找到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you can find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.40,1:11:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只说过我可以定位他们在哪 想找到得靠你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I could locate him. You've to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.43,1:11:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.13,1:12:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.08,1:12:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.46,1:12:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That really hurts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.87,1:12:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还能走吗 - 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you walk? - Yes, I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.32,1:12:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶在莱恩之前找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get to her before Lane does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.63,1:13:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你能开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa-whoa-whoa… Are you okay to drive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.25,1:13:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟前你还一副要死的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean. A minute ago you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.28,1:13:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.51,1:13:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种不祥的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not gonna end well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.02,1:13:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.01,1:13:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有台阶 台阶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stairs, stairs, stairs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.70,1:13:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,台阶 台阶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stairs, stairs, stairs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.17,1:13:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! God damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.39,1:14:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.89,1:14:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.35,1:14:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.79,1:14:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要飙车追逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a high-speed chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.45,1:14:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没租辆四轮驱动的车 这下好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just had to get the 4 by 4, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.71,1:14:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怪我 是你选的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look. Don't blame me. You chose the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.32,1:14:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明明是你一定要这辆 - 那让我来开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just had to have it! - Do you want me to drive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.42,1:14:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要让我来开吗 - 你看啊 这还是手动挡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want me to drive? - Look, it's a stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.84,1:14:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看 你开的真慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Look how slow you're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.29,1:14:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speed it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.27,1:14:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.64,1:14:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.64,1:15:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go-go-go-go. GO!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.56,1:15:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. I'm okay. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.32,1:15:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们追上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.35,1:15:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.87,1:16:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.32,1:16:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你系了安全带吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have your seat belts on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.90,1:16:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你现在才问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're asking me that now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.62,1:16:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓紧了 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on! - Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.73,1:17:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.42,1:17:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情… 好像有点出乎意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things… got a little out of hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.85,1:17:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw! Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.58,1:17:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We're good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.91,1:17:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我错过什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi boys. What did I miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.15,1:17:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个好锋利 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woo. That look sharp. Careful, careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.34,1:21:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.62,1:21:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别告诉我 你没备份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me, you made a copy of that disk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.11,1:21:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有备份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I made a copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.13,1:21:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那接下来我们去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.11,1:22:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个账册\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ledger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.29,1:22:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,存储了辛迪加的所有机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Syndicate's entire infrastructure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.51,1:22:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的身份 受操控的政客 以及资金来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who they are, the politicians they control, and where the money comes from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.32,1:22:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道的都在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's everything you want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.51,1:22:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这个所谓的账册是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think this so-called ledger is authentic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.67,1:22:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是假的 为什么莱恩这么想得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Lane want it so badly if it wasn't authentic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.31,1:22:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是真的 他又怎么会让你得到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he ever let you have it if it was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.87,1:22:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难道不像是他刻意想让我拿到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you never stop to consider he may want me to have it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.19,1:22:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪造信息和行为诱导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Misinformation, manipulation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.76,1:22:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他的强项 伊尔莎 这方面他可训练有素\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what he does, Ilsa, it's what he's trained to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.41,1:22:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩骗了你 你又误导了亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane lies to you, you sell his lies to Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.71,1:22:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 你们俩都上当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together, you're both compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.40,1:22:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是他的最终目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his ultimate objective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.81,1:22:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这也可能是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may be authentic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.72,1:22:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只相信一个人 能帮我确认真伪 那就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's only one person I trust to verify that information. You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.44,1:22:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.32,1:22:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务是带给你关于辛迪加的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}My orders were to deliver you information regarding the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.13,1:22:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务是打入辛迪加内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your orders were to infiltrate the Syndicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能得到更多的第一手资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}that We may learn more about them firsthand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.39,1:22:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是让你去证明什么 就像之前的一切 只是他们的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't prove, it's a test, like everything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.68,1:23:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过考验的唯一办法 就是回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to pass, is to go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.24,1:23:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.72,1:23:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我辜负莱恩太多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I betrayed Lane's trust too many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.45,1:23:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但每一次 都是你自己的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in every instance, you did so on you own volition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.78,1:23:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打算折磨并杀死一个美国特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was going to tortured and killed an American agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.54,1:23:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就该帮他啊 这样就还能赢得信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should've let him, and you would still have Lane's trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.06,1:23:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是代价 亨特一定能理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the trade, Hunt understands that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.18,1:23:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他死的 他是我们的同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't going to let him die. He is our ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.75,1:23:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎 在政治上 没有同盟 只有共同的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no allies in state craft, Ilsa. Only common interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.32,1:23:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且现在 伊森·亨特是一个无国籍人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it stands, Ethan Hunt is a man without a country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.04,1:23:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以杀了他不会牵扯到什么复杂的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}This makes killing him decidedly less complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.91,1:23:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是命令我去杀了亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ordering me to kill Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.80,1:23:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 我可不会那么残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good god, no. Nothing so crude as that, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.51,1:23:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但莱恩会命令你去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane will order you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.71,1:23:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而为了重获他的信任 你必须照做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to regain his trust, you will do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.37,1:23:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我去执行的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me to do a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.58,1:23:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.71,1:23:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 该恢复我身份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you bring me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.68,1:23:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我也该提醒你一下 你也是个无国籍人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might I remind you, you're without a country of your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.27,1:24:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局局长亲自向我询问过你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The director of the CIA called me inquiring about you personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.48,1:24:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护你的卧底身份 我当然只能撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course to protect your cover, I had to lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.94,1:24:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以至少在美国方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, as far as the Americans are concern, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.44,1:24:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个凶残的杀手 通缉的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a rogue assassin, a target of opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.32,1:24:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么人知道你的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}A precious few people know about your true identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.64,1:24:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们不小心忘了就惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be unfortunate if we forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.32,1:24:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没得选择 伊尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, there really is no choice, Ilsa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.37,1:24:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.72,1:24:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你还是站在我们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to know you're still with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.13,1:24:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.33,1:24:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.79,1:24:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫你没法打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you can't open it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.03,1:24:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是我永远也打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I can't open it, ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.30,1:24:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个红盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a red box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.11,1:24:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个什么 - 红盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A what? - It's a red box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.00,1:24:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国政府用它来传输国家机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British government uses it to transport national secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.95,1:24:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不太妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.02,1:24:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有三重加密 除非你有指定人的指纹和视网膜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning it's triple encrypted. You don't get into that thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.59,1:24:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及用他声音说的一段话\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you have fingerprints, retinal scan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.72,1:25:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则根本别想打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a voice phrase spoken by a specific individual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.12,1:25:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人就是英国首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister of Great Britain himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.45,1:25:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.66,1:25:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思就是 拿不到账册\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what you're saying is, there is no ledger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.72,1:25:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 没有能证明辛迪加存在的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we have no proof that the Syndicate even exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.26,1:25:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还得重头再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're back to square one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.74,1:25:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且现在 我们都被中情局通缉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only now, we're all wanted by the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.33,1:25:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真为我们骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so proud of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.23,1:25:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想通的是 为什么红盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I don't understand is why is there a red box{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.74,1:25:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,会存在摩洛哥的一个私人数据库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}sat in a private data vault in Morocco?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.80,1:25:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么莱恩会要一个他根本打不开的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would Lane want it if he can't open it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.16,1:25:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果莱恩想得到这个 那他肯定有办法打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lane wants it, you can bet that he has a plan to open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.66,1:25:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们还帮他偷了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we just help him steal it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.47,1:25:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打算绑架英国首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to take the Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.55,1:25:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.52,1:25:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是怎么绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.74,1:25:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去警告英国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we have to warn the British government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.34,1:25:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 军情六处 - 不 勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, MI6. - No, no, Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.47,1:25:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电话先放下 让我们好好考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down the phone. Let's think about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.09,1:25:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有责任通知英国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a responsibility to warn the British government, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.60,1:25:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是拿首相的命做赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not gamble with the Prime Minister's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.11,1:25:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 那个你想战胜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, just so you can beat the guy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.91,1:25:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次交锋都是他赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's beaten you at every turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.72,1:26:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这么想的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.99,1:26:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.87,1:26:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是这么想的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.82,1:26:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think right now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.14,1:26:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有别的路可选\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're incapable of seeing that there's another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.27,1:26:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时候 伊森是唯一一个能看到出路的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes Ethan is the only one capable of seeing the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.80,1:26:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他错了 维也纳的悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's wrong, then we have Vienna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.46,1:26:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会重蹈覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}all over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.58,1:26:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都不了解他 他想做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't know him. If he wants something to happen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.34,1:26:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人拦得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no preventing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.74,1:26:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才要通知英国政府啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we have to warn the British.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.71,1:26:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这样才正中他下怀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's exactly what he wants us to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.10,1:26:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的慎重考虑了吗 我们应该通知英国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you listening to yourself? We're going to warn the British.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.41,1:26:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们应该要找到莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're going to find Lane, we're going to get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.02,1:26:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他绑架首相之前逮到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he takes the Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.34,1:26:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.72,1:26:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伊森我们要找到莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Ethan. We're going to find Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.66,1:26:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But please tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.56,1:26:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该怎么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How're we going to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.60,1:27:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的事我就不追究了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All is forgiven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.29,1:27:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个并不是账册 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That isn't a ledger, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.42,1:27:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己没打开先看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't take a look for yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.73,1:27:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.16,1:27:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但文件被加密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the file was encrypted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.92,1:27:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我为什么要骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would I lie to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.47,1:27:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就能误导亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that I would lie to Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.07,1:27:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他知道那是什么的话 就不会去偷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he wouldn't have stolen it if he knew what it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.15,1:27:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也不会帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wouldn't have helped him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.90,1:27:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个移动硬盘里到底有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is actually on that disk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.93,1:27:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你对我坦白的时候 我自然会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be honest with you when you start being honest with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.50,1:27:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我心里都清楚 你回来的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and I, we both know why you come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.07,1:27:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.17,1:28:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我觉得你还有潜力 才让你活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still alive because I believe in your potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.11,1:28:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的耐心是有限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm growing impatient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.49,1:28:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你还要继续挣扎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you continue to resist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.02,1:28:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就敞开来说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we're being honest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.68,1:28:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a terrorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.16,1:28:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真如你说的话 我应该传播恐怖言论才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that were true then my goal would be to spread fear, but my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.04,1:28:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的手段… 可要高明多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}method is… far more surgical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.31,1:28:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在滥杀无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill innocent people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.31,1:28:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮助我的政府杀了很多无辜的人 而且比这多得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped my government killed many innocent people and more, so much more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.02,1:28:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有杀戮才能维持住一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing to keep things as they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.97,1:28:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在我杀人是为变革\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm killing to bring about change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.05,1:28:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想伊森·亨特不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Ethan Hunt would disagree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.76,1:28:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特就是个赌徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt is a gambler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.97,1:28:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到哪天他的运气用光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day his luck will run out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.24,1:28:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数无辜的人会因为他付出生命代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thousands of innocent people will pay the price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.95,1:28:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁更像个反派呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of us will be the villain then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.01,1:29:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面什么都没有 是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing here. It's empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.93,1:29:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇 你觉得是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm interested to see who you blame{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.97,1:29:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,该为接下来发生的一切负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what happens next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.19,1:30:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.66,1:30:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.57,1:30:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.47,1:30:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的骑车技术很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}you sure can ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.98,1:30:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森 - 你只是在完成你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan. - You're just doing your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.46,1:30:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想说这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I'm going to say about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.19,1:30:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德礼说你会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attlee said you'd understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.02,1:30:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德礼 你在英国情报机关的上司么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attlee, your handler in British Intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.56,1:30:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你给了他那个移动硬盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he didn't bring you in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.32,1:30:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都不让你全身而退吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even after you gave him the disk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.05,1:30:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚那个硬盘是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew perfectly well it was blank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.10,1:30:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.33,1:30:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定 她从我这儿拿走的硬盘和备份内容一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disk she took from me was an exact copy, I'm sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.94,1:30:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个硬盘你一直随身携带吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it in your possession the entire time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.56,1:31:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本不在乎你的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't care if you live or die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.68,1:31:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道我会把这个交给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you knew I was going to take it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.69,1:31:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.25,1:31:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就能全身而退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it would be enough to get you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.25,1:31:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means Lane{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.51,1:31:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩没有移动硬盘 只有我们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't have the disk, only we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.35,1:31:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题 如果硬盘是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a question. If the disk was blank, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.53,1:31:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}why is she still alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.64,1:31:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.53,1:31:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩想让我们找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane wanted us to find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.12,1:31:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在为谁工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who're you working for now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.05,1:31:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩 艾德礼 你的政府 我的政府 他们都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane, Attlee, your government, my government, they're all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.37,1:31:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都选择坚信自己为之奋斗的是正义的一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only think we're fighting for the right side because that's what we choose to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.73,1:31:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还有什么选择的余地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what does that leave us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.72,1:31:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 你有三个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it, you have 3 choices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.53,1:32:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 把我供出来 将硬盘交给中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, you hand me and the disk over to the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.28,1:32:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会证明辛迪加存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proof that Syndicate exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.12,1:32:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩就成了他们的目标 而你的工作也完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane becomes their problem, and… your work is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.64,1:32:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是这么想的 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My thoughts exactly. - Works for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.18,1:32:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道 他们不会相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know they're not going to believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.33,1:32:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们所有人都会被判叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you all will be trialed for treason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.11,1:32:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩依旧逍遥法外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane goes free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.62,1:32:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid she's has a point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.52,1:32:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 你放我走 让我去面对未知的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, you let me walk away to an uncertain fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.71,1:32:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着用这个硬盘去引诱莱恩上钩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You use the disk as bait to trap Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.58,1:32:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你内心深处又害怕棋逢敌手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But some part of you suspect you've met your match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.39,1:32:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样冒险赌一把 硬盘最终很有可能落入莱恩手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And being a gambler, you'll probably end up handing Lane that disk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.11,1:32:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你情愿与否\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether you want to or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.42,1:32:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is entirely possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.86,1:32:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个选择呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And option three?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.98,1:32:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起远走高飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come away with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.95,1:32:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.49,1:32:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.00,1:32:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那莱恩怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Lane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.77,1:32:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管什么莱恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.95,1:32:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个莱恩倒了 也会有第二个莱恩出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will always be another Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.44,1:33:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会有像我们这样的人去对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will always be people like us to face him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.17,1:33:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经完成了任务 却被抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done our part and we've been cast aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.18,1:33:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以是任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.82,1:33:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,做任何想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.74,1:33:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只取决于你是走是留\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a matter of going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.10,1:33:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是莱恩派你过来传信的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane sent you to deliver a message, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.73,1:33:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经救了你两次 不可能再救你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you life twice. I won't be able to do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.70,1:33:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the message?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.29,1:33:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.06,1:34:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parking garage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.56,1:34:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟 跟紧她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, stay with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.57,1:34:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.83,1:34:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.35,1:34:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给我们下了个套 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}She set us up, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.75,1:34:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她只是传信而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she delivered a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.64,1:34:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她耍了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She set us up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.27,1:34:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她早知道计划是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew this would happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.54,1:34:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有莱恩知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Lane knows what's going to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.33,1:34:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个任务给你 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a job for you, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.24,1:34:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你的朋友 你会答应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the sake of your friend, you will do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.02,1:34:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.18,1:35:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权选择是否接受这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission, should you choose to accept it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.13,1:35:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚午夜 把移动硬盘破解后交到我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is to bring me the unlocked disk by midnight today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.76,1:35:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 请说出你的决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now say the words, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.83,1:35:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.23,1:35:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.41,1:35:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.05,1:35:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要那个硬盘 破解后的 今晚午夜之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants the disk, unlocked, by midnight tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.13,1:35:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 这世界上只有一个人能解锁那个硬盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, there's only one person on earth who can unlock that disk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.91,1:35:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须得绑架首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to take the Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.24,1:35:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再好好考虑下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just think about that for a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.16,1:35:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是能救回班吉的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only way to get Benji back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.46,1:35:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 这么做正中莱恩下怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, that's exactly what Lane wants you to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.00,1:35:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不管怎样都只能如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why it has to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.52,1:35:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们打败莱恩的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we beat Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.40,1:36:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是让一切都重回正轨的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we make everything right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.60,1:36:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道了吗 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see? Can you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.15,1:36:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 威廉·勃兰特的电话 他说有紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Brandt, sir. He says it's urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.66,1:36:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会想通的 勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a feeling you'd come to your senses, Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.77,1:36:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是实在走投无路了 我是不会打给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only calling you because I've no other choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.29,1:36:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要阻止一场灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to prevent a catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.02,1:36:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全理解 你现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can understand that. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.24,1:36:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伦敦 - 掉头去伦敦 立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- London - Reroute us to London, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.75,1:36:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伦敦哪里 - 现在还不能说 等下了飞机再告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where in London? - I'll tell you when you land, not before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.51,1:36:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没心思陪你玩游戏 勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested in playing games, Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.50,1:36:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没心思眼睁睁看着我的朋友被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not interested in seeing my friends get killed either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.63,1:36:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 如果要我背叛他们 就要按我的方法来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I'm going to betray them, we're going to do this in my terms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.18,1:36:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能照我说的做 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my terms only. Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.14,1:36:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持电话通畅 随后给你指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your phone on, instruction will follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.64,1:37:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 差不多该走了吧 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should have been gone by now. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.76,1:37:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.49,1:37:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚就要绑架英国首相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're suppose to take down the Prime Minister of Great Britain tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.15,1:37:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.05,1:37:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.51,1:37:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在想不到别的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.55,1:37:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither can I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.54,1:37:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们所做的一切都是为了朋友 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we do, we have to do for our friends, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.36,1:38:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him ready, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.40,1:38:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,勃兰特 打给我是明智之举 亨特在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right to call me, Brandt. Where is Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.47,1:38:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在来的路上 我们没有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on his way. We don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.44,1:38:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到底想干什么 - 重要的是他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does he intend to do? - What matter is he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.21,1:38:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我需要你保证他的人身安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need your reassurance that it's going to stay that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.38,1:39:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特要对首相下手这个消息 你通知英国政府了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you informed the British Government that Hunt has targeted the Prime Minister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.76,1:39:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你捉到他 活捉 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will help you capture him… alive. That is the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.52,1:39:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,勃兰特 你从你朋友身上沾染到了一些坏习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked up some terrible habits from your friend, Brandt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.16,1:39:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最坏的一个就是 你居然以为自己能掌控全局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst of them being that you still believe you can control any outcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.52,1:39:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.03,1:39:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德礼局长 艾德礼局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Attlee. Chief Attlee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.36,1:39:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利局长 真高兴能在这遇到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director Hunley, how delightful to see you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.74,1:39:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我们通话时 你正在摩洛哥抓一个叛逃的特工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time we spoke, you were hunting rogue agents in Morocco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.70,1:39:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德礼局长 我有证据表明首相大人正处于危险当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Attlee, I have reason to believe that the Prime Minister's life is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.79,1:39:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.38,1:40:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有比两万二出价更高的吗 有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any advance on 22, 000? Anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.27,1:40:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两万二一次 两万二两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going once. Going twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.00,1:40:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交 慷概的首相夫人竞得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold! To our generous Chairwoman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.78,1:40:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 军情六处的艾德礼局长要见您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. Chief Attlee from MI6 needs to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.93,1:40:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says it's urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.84,1:40:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.83,1:40:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么回事 - 先生 事关国家安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this all about? - It's a matter of national security, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.99,1:40:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不论任何情况 任何人都不许进来 - 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Under no circumstances is anyone to enter. - Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.92,1:40:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.27,1:40:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人是谁 他为什么要绑架我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this man? Why is he after me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.06,1:40:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相 恐怕亨利局长和我都难辞其咎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid, Prime Minister, Director Hunley and I share responsibility for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.18,1:41:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特是一个让我们蒙羞的情报组织的特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt was part of a disgrace intelligence agency which is since been dissolved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.64,1:41:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,组织一解散 他就叛逃了 他一心想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's gone rogue, unfortunately intend on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.37,1:41:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图捣毁一个并不存在的恐怖犯罪组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}dismantling an imaginary terror network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.91,1:41:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是最新情报表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But new intelligence suggest that he's been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.64,1:41:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直被你们国家的一位前特工操纵\N{\fnArial\fs30}manipulated by one of your own former agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.20,1:41:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相大人 是伊尔莎·福斯特 她在两年前失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa Faust, Prime Minister. She disappeared 2 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.21,1:41:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意的话我想问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you don't mind I asking, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.87,1:41:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟这个神秘组织有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do I have to do with this phantom network?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.33,1:41:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 这位是威廉·勃兰特 亨特以前的同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this is William Brandt, a former colleague of Hunt's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.29,1:41:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将为您解释 关于这个针对您的阴谋的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came forward with first hand knowledge of the plot against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.60,1:41:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 亨特有一个只能由您打开的虚拟红盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. Hunt is in possession of a virtual red box that can only be open by you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.20,1:41:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为这是捣毁辛迪加组织的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes it is the key to bring down the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.40,1:41:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说 辛迪加 - 是的 先生 他就是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Syndicate, you say? - Yes, Sir. That's what he calls it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.18,1:41:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attlee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.92,1:41:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的不会是那个「辛迪加」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't possibly be talking about that "Syndicate"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.66,1:41:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你向我保证过 那个「辛迪加」只是个实验吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you assured me that, that "Syndicate" was merely an exercise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.75,1:41:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那确实是 我能向您保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was, Prime Minister. I can assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.16,1:41:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 中情局说明的情况好像并不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, here we have the Central Intelligence Agency indicating otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.36,1:42:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不太明白 - 首相大人 您正处于危险当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand. - Prime Minister, your life is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.08,1:42:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们的首要任务是把您转移至安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think our first priority is to move you to a secure location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.10,1:42:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 所罗门·莱恩这个名字 您听着有印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. Does the name, Solomon Lane, ring a bell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.57,1:42:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 我记得这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Unfortunately, it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.48,1:42:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 辛迪加是真实存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there actually is a Syndicate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.47,1:42:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是艾德礼局长设想的一个雏形\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a hypothetical brainchild of Chief Attlee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.65,1:42:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,招募其他国家退役的特工 给他们新的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recruit former agents from other nations. supply them with a new identity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.99,1:42:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用他们除掉我们国内外的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and use them to surgically remove our enemies, both at home and abroad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.56,1:42:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的执行预算都藏在海外一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its operating budget was to be hidden offshore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.90,1:42:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我能打开的红盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a virtual red box which I alone would control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.48,1:42:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这项目让我集法官 陪审 执行者这三种角色于一身\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have made me judge, jury, and executioner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.15,1:42:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且责任全免\N{\fnArial\fs30}with zero accountability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.63,1:42:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一开始就坚决反对了这项提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rejected the proposal unequivocally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.21,1:42:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 有人还向我保证 这项目永远不会执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furthermore, I was given every assurance it never pass the planning stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.83,1:42:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相大人 辛迪加根本就不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime Minister, there is no any Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.79,1:42:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人都被福斯特特工给骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people have been duped by agent Faust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.24,1:43:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德礼 把这套说辞留到听证会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attlee. Save it for the public inquiry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.83,1:43:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我建议您不要离开这间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I urge you not to leave this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.33,1:43:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 请您考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.22,1:43:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特是经过特别训练的人 而且不达目的誓不罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt is uniquely trained and highly motivated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.72,1:43:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能与他抗衡 他也不露出任何破绽\N{\fnArial\fs30}A specialist without equal, immune to any counter measures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.99,1:43:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他拿不到的情报 也没有他越不过的防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no secret he cannot extract. No security he cannot breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.18,1:43:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有他伪装不了的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No person he cannot become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.74,1:43:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他有可能已经猜到会有这段对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has mostly likely anticipated this very conversation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.08,1:43:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,正等着我们转移时袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is waiting to strike in whatever direction we move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.28,1:43:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 亨特他不会善罢甘休的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. Hunt is the living manifestation of destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.44,1:43:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而您 现在是他的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has made you his mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.73,1:43:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.56,1:43:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.12,1:43:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 请离开首相大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, please step away from the Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.19,1:43:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 请放松 一切都在掌控之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax, Sir. Everything is going to be alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.46,1:44:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾德礼朝我开了一枪 - 是的 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Attlee shot me - Yes, he did, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.95,1:44:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特 你要知道你这么做会把美英关系拉回到独立战争时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt, I hope you realize you set back US, UK relations to the American revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.65,1:44:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 特殊时期 特殊处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate times, desperate measures, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.39,1:44:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在 - 随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here. - Standby to receive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.24,1:44:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.57,1:44:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相秘书通知我来见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister's office ask me to meet him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.19,1:44:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.69,1:44:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.76,1:44:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,虹膜扫描 确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retinal scan, confirm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.84,1:44:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿就好了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some convenience, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.78,1:44:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手好暖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a very warm hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.37,1:44:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,指纹认证 确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biometric, confirm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.84,1:45:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 语音提示是「吉普林」 - 语音提示是「吉普林」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The prompt is "KIPLING". - The prompt is "KIPLING".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.87,1:45:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我需要一个解密口令 提示是「吉普林」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I'm gonna need a pass phrase, the prompt is "KIPLING".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.01,1:45:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.62,1:45:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果所有人都失去理智 咒骂你 你仍能保持头脑清醒」\N{\fnArial\fs30}" If you can keep your head when all about you. Are losing theirs…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.28,1:45:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果所有人都怀疑你 你仍能相信自己」\N{\fnArial\fs30}" If you can trust yourself when all men doubt you "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.36,1:45:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了吗 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it? - I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.29,1:45:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 全都搞到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man, do I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.89,1:45:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来见首相大人 - 我们收到命令 任何人都不能进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here to see the Prime Minister. - We were told not to let anybody in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.19,1:45:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁的命令 - 你的啊 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By whom? - By you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.73,1:45:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 这是怎么回事 警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunley, what is this? Security!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.17,1:45:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德礼局长 你能来赴约真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Attlee. Kind of you to accepted our invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.15,1:46:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.49,1:46:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你创造了辛迪加\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you created the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.62,1:46:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是莱恩叛逃了 把它变成了反抗你的组织 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Lane went rogue and turn it against you, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.47,1:46:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 一直急于掩盖这个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've been desperately trying to cover it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.96,1:46:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么她把硬盘交给你的时候 你把内容清除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you erased the disk which she brought it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.83,1:46:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.27,1:46:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 亨利局长有关于伊尔莎·福斯特的问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Director Hunley has some questions for you regarding Ilsa Faust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.85,1:46:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说 你是怎么陷害她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Namely, how you frame her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.34,1:46:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's also true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.68,1:46:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the antidote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.16,1:46:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当首相发现关于辛迪加的真相的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Prime Minister found out about the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.84,1:46:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾德礼攻击了他 - 是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Attlee had attacked him. - Yes, that's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.81,1:46:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 是你救了首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you saved the Prime Minister, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.55,1:46:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.42,1:46:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.06,1:47:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.80,1:47:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你快要完成任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cutting it very close, Ethan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.97,1:47:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到你想要的东西了 我该去哪碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have what you want. Where do I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.84,1:47:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.81,1:47:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没在十五分钟内赶到 他会杀了班吉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm not there in 15 minutes, he'll kill Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.13,1:47:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务是捣毁辛迪加\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mission is to bring down the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.00,1:47:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果莱恩拿到了这些资金\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lane gets his hands on that money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.60,1:47:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就相当于造就了一个超级恐怖集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're unleashing a terrorist superpower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.30,1:47:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会活捉到我的 这点我可以确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll never take me alive. I'll make sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.17,1:47:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果你不能安全回来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens, Ethan, if you can't make it back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.77,1:47:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.77,1:47:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.05,1:47:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,向您致以诚挚的问候 首相大人 如果您正在观看这则信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, Prime Minister. If you are viewing this message, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.06,1:47:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就说明您选择启动辛迪加计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}it means that you have chosen to activate the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.97,1:48:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张盘可以让您控制无法追查的二十四亿英镑的使用权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}This drive gives you access to 2.4 billion pound sterling in untraceable currency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.36,1:48:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些资金可以让辛迪加项目秘密运作达数十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will allow the Syndicate to operate undetected for decades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.23,1:48:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,获取资金的步骤如下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instructions to access these funds are as follows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.36,1:49:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特先生 一切都要结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the end, Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.99,1:49:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.37,1:49:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,两磅塑胶炸药 五百三十口径的滚珠承轴\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 pounds of Semtex, 530 caliber ball bearings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.22,1:49:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友正坐在一个高敏压力触发器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend is sitting on a highly sensitive-pressure trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.97,1:49:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 别轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no sudden moves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.32,1:49:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的终极考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your final test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.67,1:50:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等莱恩拿到他想到的东西 我就杀了你和班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Lane has what he wants, I kill you and Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.42,1:50:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果拿不到 所有人都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, everyone dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.95,1:50:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间考虑了 伊森 请坐下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time to think, Ethan. Have a seat, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.52,1:50:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人性啊 我选择的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human nature, my weapon of choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.31,1:50:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我在音像店杀死那个年轻姑娘开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the moment I killed the young lady in the record shop, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.01,1:50:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会不顾一切来抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you would stop at nothing to catch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.63,1:50:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道伊尔莎没有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also knew Ilsa wouldn't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.33,1:50:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是她那晚上制服你还是有意放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether she broke you that night you met or let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.08,1:50:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你有没有在摩洛哥放走她 也不管她到底见没见艾德礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you let her run in Morocco. Whether she went to Attlee or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.48,1:50:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都确定我们一定会走到现在这一步 在此时此地了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were certain we would end up where we are… right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.44,1:51:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过话说回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.27,1:51:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的武器也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.81,1:51:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你 莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you, Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.06,1:51:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直徘徊在道德边界 你有了信仰危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere along the line you had a crisis of faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.09,1:51:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此人命对你来说轻若鸿毛 也许在你眼里也从未重要过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human life didn't matter anymore, or maybe it never really did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.75,1:51:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你杀了太多无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, you killed too many innocent people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.96,1:51:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,却从不质问谁下达的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}without ever asking who was giving the orders or why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.16,1:51:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不问为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.56,1:51:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把变成现在这样的原因归咎于制度\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blame the system for what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.77,1:51:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.15,1:51:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.18,1:51:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但冰冻三尺 非一日之寒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Rome wasn't destroyed in a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.16,1:51:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要帮助 需要大量资金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needed help, you needed the money. A lot of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.03,1:51:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你会不择手段的得到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll stop at nothing to get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.26,1:51:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我知道我会让你自投罗网\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I know I'm going to put you in a box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.39,1:51:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 硬盘在哪 - 硬盘在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is the disk? - Where is the disk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.76,1:51:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是喜欢玩游戏吗 我给你准备了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like to play games. I've a game for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.77,1:51:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算给你五千万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you 50 million dollars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.05,1:51:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,放班吉走\N{\fnArial\fs30}to let Benji go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.38,1:52:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 硬盘在哪 - 硬盘在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is the disk? - Where is the disk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.27,1:52:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正看着呢 我就是那个硬盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at it. I am the disk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.23,1:52:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记住了那些二十四亿英镑的所有数字账号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I memorized it all 2.4 billion in number accounts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.78,1:52:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果炸弹引爆 你就什么也得不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that vest goes off, you get nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.94,1:52:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了这笔钱 你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without this money, you're nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.48,1:52:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了我 你什么也干不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without me, you are nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.22,1:52:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许现在你觉得我只是虚张声势 我绝不会让我的朋友去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, you're thinking it's bluff. I'd never let my friends die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.32,1:52:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能记住硬盘里的全部账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't possibly memorize the entire disk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.62,1:52:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定这些 只有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.04,1:52:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让班吉走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Benji go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.36,1:53:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.46,1:53:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们再靠近一步 就朝我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come 1 step closer, shoot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.58,1:53:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.26,1:53:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我和你说过 总有一天你的运气会用完吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember I told you, one day you were going to take things too far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.24,1:53:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒一下 这是我在说话 不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me speaking, by the way. It's not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.09,1:53:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我和你 面对面解决 莱恩 才能结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way this ends is you and me, Lane, face to face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.06,1:53:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这一次我不是被锁在玻璃箱子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this time I won't be locked in a glass box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.09,1:53:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想拿走你的钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.43,1:53:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让骨科医生再来拷问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bone doctor is going to beat it out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.87,1:53:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 放班吉走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let Benji go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.44,1:53:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 三 九\N{\fnArial\fs30}1… 3… 9…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.61,1:54:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.94,1:54:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森 - 勃兰特和卢瑟在等你 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan. - Brandt and Luther are waiting. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.91,1:54:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接下来做什么 - 杀了那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do I do? - Kill the woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.16,1:54:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我活捉亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need Hunt alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.53,1:55:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说 - 我是班吉 我该去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - It's Benji, where am I going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.39,1:55:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们来了 - 我们还没准备好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're coming. - We're not ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.14,1:55:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.88,1:55:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.31,2:00:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对面较量 如你所愿 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face to face. Just as you wish, Ethan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.23,2:00:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不爽吧 我懂这种滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.08,2:00:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这就是所罗门·莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, this is Solomon Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.03,2:00:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.02,2:00:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是碟中谍小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet the IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.45,2:02:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're free now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.79,2:02:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.74,2:02:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.75,2:02:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经完成了我的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done my part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.20,2:02:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.83,2:02:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, we got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.94,2:02:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hurry now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.99,2:02:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.36,2:03:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.76,2:03:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director Hunley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.24,2:03:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亨利局长 - 呃 主席先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Director Hunley. - Ah… Mr. Chairman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.34,2:03:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月之前 你在议会议员面前 要求解散碟中谍小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}6 months ago, you stood before this panel and demanded that the IMF be dissolved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.26,2:03:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is correct, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.93,2:03:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么解释今天的证词\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you explain your testimony today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.97,2:03:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实很简单 我们有理由相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite simple really. We had reason to believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.23,2:03:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪加已经渗透到政府的最高层\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Syndicate have infiltrated our government at the highest level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.78,2:03:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让我们的人潜入那个组织 他的卧底身份必须万全\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order for our men to infiltrate that organization, his cover had to be absolute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.35,2:03:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个行动只有我和少数碟中谍小组的成员知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole operation was known only to myself and a handful of IMF agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.81,2:03:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以碟中谍小组的解散 只是这个计划的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the shuttering of the IMF was all part of an elaborate scheme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.84,2:03:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就为了揭露这个所谓的辛迪加 - 是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To expose this so call Syndicate? - That is correct, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.21,2:04:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这也是你今天来的原因 请求恢复碟中谍小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why you're here today, asking for the IMF to be reinstated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.78,2:04:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is correct, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.97,2:04:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利局长 我不确定委员会是否赞同你这种做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure the Committee approves of your methods, Director Hunley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.57,2:04:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,特殊时期 特殊对待 主席先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate times, desperate measures, Mr. Chairman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.87,2:04:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 勃兰特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, Mr. Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.73,2:04:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么解释这次的欺瞒行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you justify this deception?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.05,2:04:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没有获得部长的许可之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can neither confirm nor deny details of any operation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.47,2:04:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既不能承认也不能否认这些行动的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the Secretary's approval.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.54,2:04:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入碟中谍小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.98,2:04:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary.{\r}
